拌均勻食用，桌上有「椒麻粉」非常搭！喜歡吃辣的一定要加\n🐓唐揚雞：四塊，肉質一口咬下不會太硬，保有雞肉原汁，完全不柴，熱騰騰吃下非常刷嘴\n\n❓不確定是不是所有湯都可以調鹹度，有聽到櫃檯有問其中一位客人要不要調鹹度\n\n🚇在三重國小捷運站出來走大概8分鐘距離，算很方便，不過若是開車就不太好停\n\n🥲唯一缺點應該就是生意很好，要先填好名字電話末三碼，現場會叫號（所以不能離開），會需要耐心等候\n\n整體來說食物有特色且好吃，不能續湯，會有幾種醬在桌上可以依照口味自己加，麵體粗細硬軟可選，如果喜歡重口味會喜歡，反之可能會覺得太鹹～",null,[0,156]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/13527711239222049474/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXVTA1dFZYUlNSVVpOWVVoS2ExUjZWbmxPTTA1aFdtNVpNVlJyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13527711239222049474/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXVTA1dFZYUlNSVVpOWVVoS2ExUjZWbmxPTTA1aFdtNVpNVlJyUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/13527711239222049474/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXVTA1dFZYUlNSVVpOWVVoS2ExUjZWbmxPTTA1aFdtNVpNVlJyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13527711239222049474/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXVTA1dFZYUlNSVVpOWVVoS2ExUjZWbmxPTTA1aFdtNVpNVlJyUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/13527711239222049474/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXVTA1dFZYUlNSVVpOWVVoS2ExUjZWbmxPTTA1aFdtNVpNVlJyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13527711239222049474/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXVTA1dFZYUlNSVVpOWVVoS2ExUjZWbmxPTTA1aFdtNVpNVlJyUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,6979,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWU05tVXRSRUZNYUhKa1R6VnlOM05hWm5ZMVRrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x9b4000f07822e17f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlVSNmUtREFMaHJkTzVyN3NaZnY1TkE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWU05tVXRSRUZNYUhKa1R6VnlOM05hWm5ZMVRrRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWU05tVXRSRUZNYUhKa1R6VnlOM05hWm5ZMVRrRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWU05tVXRSRUZN